  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Ju Kai Bei runs Habitual Strength Gu from the start of the match, so his strength rises the longer the Gu stays active. Spectators note that opponents need to finish him quickly rather than give him time. After he bursts out dragon-elephant strength, his power falls back and Habitual Strength Gu begins to accumulate again.",
        "chapters": [
          317
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-stage-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Spectators liken Fang Yuan’s eight beast strengths to a huge water jar with a small outlet: All-out Effort Gu can force that outlet to discharge at top speed as a continuous thin stream, while Habitual Strength Gu is like a bucket that must draw from the jar and accumulate before erupting.",
        "chapters": [
          317
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "battle-stage-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ju Kai Bei must keep accumulating, then summon a beast phantom; even he does not know when the phantom will appear. If he attacks and only one dragon-elephant strength appears, he has to accumulate again, and his battle strength falls for a stretch. Ju Kai Bei’s strength is like a water jar and Habitual Strength Gu like a bucket that must draw from it each time. Habitual Strength Gu at rank four is inferior to All-out Effort Gu. His habit of fighting around that accumulate then erupt rhythm also leaves a blind spot Fang Yuan exploits when All-out Effort Gu can be revoked mid-charge.",
        "chapters": [
          318
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "limits-against-all-out-effort-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
